//
// Device-free check that pack_q4k_cascade, which packs a whole matrix at once,
// emits the same bytes as pack_q4k_block applied block by block.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/check_proj_qmm_pack.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: default: cascade matches the per-block packer: True
// CHECK: core_major: cascade matches the per-block packer: True
// CHECK: iter_major: cascade matches the per-block packer: True
// CHECK: dual_chan: cascade matches the per-block packer: True
